<title>CHILE: Istethmar buys stake in Chile's Masisa.</title>
<headline>Istethmar buys stake in Chile's Masisa.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istethmar Ltd has bought 18.5 million shares in Chilean forestry company Maderas y Sinteticos SA (Masisa) for $10 million, said Inversiones Pathfinder, Masisa's main shareholder.</p>
<p>&quot;The incorporation of this partner... will strengthen further the company's operations in the Far East, especially in the Chinese market,&quot; said the statement.</p>
<p>Istethmar distributes commodities in eastern Asia.</p>
<p>Masisa is Chile's largest wood board producer and has factories in southern Chile and Argentina.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
